;; Verified public-register citations for the legal entity archived by this repository.
;;
;; Every row is checked live by tools/verify_citations.cljs:
;;   * GET :cite/url must answer HTTP 2xx
;;   * :cite/expect-substring must appear in the response body
;;
;; A URL that cannot be fetched, or whose body no longer carries the claim, is a
;; DRIFT and fails the gate. Nothing is recorded here that was not retrieved.
;;
;; FIVE independent authorities are cited, not one:
;;   * GLEIF, the global LEI system (the entity record, the RA000412 entry in the
;;     registration-authorities registry, the T417 entry in the entity-legal-forms
;;     registry, and the LEI record of the managing LOU)
;;   * Japan's National Tax Agency, at the corporate-number publication site
;;     (houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp) under corporate number 1010401056795
;;   * Japan's METI, at gBizINFO (info.gbiz.go.jp) under the same corporate number
;;   * the United States, via the SEC's EDGAR submissions API (SoftBank Group Corp.
;;     is an EDGAR filer, CIK 0001065521 -- 13F-HR, Schedule 13D/G, F-6EF)
;;   * the issuer itself, at the Privacy Policy pages this repository archives
;;     (EN and JA) and at its published inquiry form
;;
;; HOW THE JAPANESE STATE AND GLEIF ARE LINKED -- BY SHARED KEY. GLEIF names
;; RA000412 -- Companies Registration (登記) at the Legal Affairs Bureau (法務局)
;; -- as both register of record and validation authority, and records
;; registeredAs 0104-01-056795 (the 会社法人等番号, the commercial-registry
;; number). Japan's corporate number (法人番号) is BY CONSTRUCTION one check
;; digit prefixed to those same 12 digits: 1 + 010401056795 = 1010401056795.
;; The NTA and gBizINFO rows below resolve THAT number to this legal name at
;; this seat. So the GLEIF<->Japan link is a direct key, not an address match.
;; (Contrast the SEC: EDGAR carries "lei":null -- the SEC does not record this
;; entity's LEI, so the GLEIF<->SEC link is by name + address only. Row
;; sec-lei-null keeps that fact checked; it goes red the day EDGAR starts
;; printing the LEI, at which point a direct-key row should replace it.)
;;
;; THE ADDRESS TRIANGLE. GLEIF records 海岸一丁目７番１号, 東京都 港区, postal
;; 105-7537 (row gleif-postal). The SEC's own address record prints 1-7-1
;; KAIGAN, MINATO-KU, TOKYO, 105-7537, Japan (rows sec-street, sec-locality,
;; sec-city, sec-zip, sec-country). The NTA and gBizINFO print
;; 東京都港区海岸１丁目７番１号 (rows nta-address, gbiz-address). Three states'
;; worth of registers, one seat, none of them quoting each other.
;;
;; WHY THE REGISTER OF RECORD HAS NO PER-ENTITY ROW. The Legal Affairs Bureau's
;; registry is served through the paid, login-gated 登記情報提供サービス at
;; www1.touki.or.jp (the very website GLEIF's RA000412 entry names). The portal
;; answers HTTP 200 (row touki-portal) but exposes no stable public per-entity
;; URL, so no row can cite the registry extract itself. The registry NUMBER is
;; instead corroborated through the NTA corporate number, which embeds it (see
;; the shared-key paragraph above).
;;
;; WHAT IS DELIBERATELY NOT CITED. GLEIF's nextRenewalDate moves every year by
;; construction; a row on it would go red on schedule while saying nothing
;; about the entity. The TSE ticker 9984 (claimed in README.md) has no
;; server-rendered per-entity page at jpx.co.jp that this gate could check, so
;; it is NOT proven by any row here -- the managing-LOU rows prove only that
;; the LOU is Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc., not that this entity lists there.
;; The EDGAR body also carries a filings list that changes with every filing;
;; rows target only stable header fields.
;;
;; ARCHIVED SOURCE-URL DRIFT (recorded honestly). This repository's
;; 80-data/public/tos.journal.edn records :tos/source-url
;; https://www.softbankgroup.com/en/privacy. Measured 2026-08-22, that URL
;; redirects to the HOMEPAGE https://group.softbank/en, which carries no
;; privacy policy text -- and the archived journal body is in fact homepage
;; text, so the archive itself captured the post-drift page. The current
;; Privacy Policy is served at https://group.softbank/en/privacy (EN, rows
;; issuer-privacy-en-*) and https://group.softbank/privacy (JA, rows
;; issuer-privacy-ja-*), which are what this catalog cites. Re-archiving the
;; journal from the current URL is separate work, out of scope for this
;; catalog.
;;
;; :cite/row-kind is the honest part of this catalog and should be read before
;; the claims:
;;
;;   :identity   the substring names this entity, its identifiers, or its seat.
;;               Point the URL at a different company and the row fails.
;;   :attribute  the substring is TRUE OF THIS ENTITY BUT NOT ONLY OF IT
;;               (status ACTIVE, jurisdiction JP, city TOKYO, ticker prefix).
;;               Such a row can survive a swap to a similar company. It is
;;               recorded because it corroborates, not because it identifies.
;;   :definition the substring resolves a code or body the entity record points
;;               at (RA000412, T417, the managing LOU, the registry portal). It
;;               says the named register, legal form or LOU exists; it says
;;               nothing about SoftBank Group by itself.
;;
;; Of the entries below, 13 are :identity, 19 are :attribute and 6 are
;; :definition. A reader who treats all 38 as identifying would overstate what
;; this catalog proves -- which is the error this field exists to prevent.
;;
;; Substrings are taken from the RAW response body (GLEIF JSON escapes Japanese
;; text as \uXXXX, so GLEIF rows pin ASCII fragments; the NTA, gBizINFO and
;; issuer HTML serve UTF-8 and are pinned in Japanese) and were each checked
;; against the fetched bytes before this file was written (2026-08-22).
